000100*================================================================
000200* RDCNT  HOME CONTENTS RISK DETAIL
000300*        THE 60-BYTE POL-RISK-DETAIL OF POLREC FOR LINE CNT.
000400*        USED BY RATCNT01.
000500*        policy-admin FILLS THE SAME 60 BYTES IN PRMCOMM
000600*        REQ-RISK-DETAIL WHEN IT CALLS PRMCALC0.
000700*
000800*  HIGH-RISK-ITEMS ITEMS OVER 2,000 EACH
000900*  ALARM           Y = MONITORED ALARM
001000*  UNOCCUPIED-DAYS LONGEST PERIOD EMPTY, DAYS PER YEAR
001100*  STUDENT-LET     Y = LET TO STUDENTS
001200*================================================================
001300 01  WS-CNT-DETAIL.
001400     05  WS-HIGH-RISK-ITEMS       PIC 9(02).
001500     05  WS-ALARM                 PIC X(01).
001600     05  WS-UNOCCUPIED-DAYS       PIC 9(03).
001700     05  WS-STUDENT-LET           PIC X(01).
001800     05  FILLER                  PIC X(53).
